    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155270/extras/ce79b77e17548eff29f6a60dbbc26b1a.avif?t=1731488745\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nakamon: A New Era of Creature Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nakamon is a 2D pixel art creature fighter where strategy, speed, and tactical depth collide. Assemble a team of 5 unique Nakamon and dive into fast-paced 5v5 battles that will test your skills. With 16 distinct elemental types and up to 4 moves per creature, every battle is a fresh challenge full of strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Turn Order System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155270/extras/a30629cc03f95729bf06032134f273c7.avif?t=1731488745\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional turn-based games, Nakamon introduces a <strong>dynamic turn order</strong> system. Every creature\u2019s speed determines when they act, meaning the turn sequence constantly shifts. It could be two of your Nakamon acting in a row, followed by three of your opponent\u2019s\u2014it\u2019s up to you to adapt to the ever-changing battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elemental Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 16 elemental types, every Nakamon brings its own strengths and weaknesses to the battlefield. Master the art of type matchups to deal extra damage, resist incoming attacks, and outsmart your opponents. The combination of elements and move effects creates nearly endless possibilities for team composition and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stunning Pixel Art and Move Effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155270/extras/48fd2475126ec6f744b09dbdff2c4713.avif?t=1731488745\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Nakamon can perform up to 4 unique moves, complete with stunning pixel art animations and impactful effects. From devastating single-target attacks to area-of-effect abilities, every move feels powerful and visually exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Team, Master the Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155270/extras/0d96039bf31d4bc622aad4f64f7bd964.avif?t=1731488745\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different Nakamon combinations, move sets, and strategies. Whether you favor speed, power, defense, or balanced tactics, you\u2019ll need to adapt and optimize your team to win. Victory isn\u2019t just about having the strongest creatures\u2014it\u2019s about outsmarting your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155270/extras/ce79b77e17548eff29f6a60dbbc26b1a.avif?t=1731488745\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nakamon: A New Era of Creature Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nakamon is a 2D pixel art creature fighter where strategy, speed, and tactical depth collide. Assemble a team of 5 unique Nakamon and dive into fast-paced 5v5 battles that will test your skills. With 16 distinct elemental types and up to 4 moves per creature, every battle is a fresh challenge full of strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Turn Order System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155270/extras/a30629cc03f95729bf06032134f273c7.avif?t=1731488745\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional turn-based games, Nakamon introduces a <strong>dynamic turn order</strong> system. Every creature\u2019s speed determines when they act, meaning the turn sequence constantly shifts. It could be two of your Nakamon acting in a row, followed by three of your opponent\u2019s\u2014it\u2019s up to you to adapt to the ever-changing battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elemental Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 16 elemental types, every Nakamon brings its own strengths and weaknesses to the battlefield. Master the art of type matchups to deal extra damage, resist incoming attacks, and outsmart your opponents. The combination of elements and move effects creates nearly endless possibilities for team composition and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stunning Pixel Art and Move Effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155270/extras/48fd2475126ec6f744b09dbdff2c4713.avif?t=1731488745\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Nakamon can perform up to 4 unique moves, complete with stunning pixel art animations and impactful effects. From devastating single-target attacks to area-of-effect abilities, every move feels powerful and visually exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Team, Master the Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155270/extras/0d96039bf31d4bc622aad4f64f7bd964.avif?t=1731488745\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different Nakamon combinations, move sets, and strategies. Whether you favor speed, power, defense, or balanced tactics, you\u2019ll need to adapt and optimize your team to win. Victory isn\u2019t just about having the strongest creatures\u2014it\u2019s about outsmarting your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Nakamon is a fast-paced, strategic creature battler. Build your team of 5 Nakamon and outsmart your opponents in dynamic, speed-based combat. With 16 elemental types and a wide variety of moves, every battle offers unique tactical challenges. Enter the arena and prove your skill!",
